title: '`pallet-transaction-payment`: doc sweep'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Fixes stale documentation across the transaction-payment family: the `Val`/`Pre` docs named
      `ChargeAssetTxPayment`, which lives in the sibling crate, instead of this crate's
      `ChargeTransactionPayment`; `remaining_txfee` referenced a nonexistent `charge_from_txfee`
      instead of `withdraw_txfee`; asset-tx-payment still mentioned paying via `Currency`, removed
      in #11822. Also a missing verb in the skip-feeless-payment integration docs and minor typos.
      Docs only.

crates:
  - name: pallet-transaction-payment
    bump: none
  - name: pallet-asset-tx-payment
    bump: none
  - name: pallet-skip-feeless-payment
    bump: none
